WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
Oops, someone

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:08,130
No matter how bad it is, I dare to say that I am a prostitute for nothing.

3
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:10,130
What did you tell me then?

4
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,130
Say your wife is young and beautiful

5
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:14,130
More juicy than a little girl

6
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:15,130
Such an old witch

7
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,130
You have the nerve to ask me for money

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,130
Didn’t I choose it for you?

9
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:22,380
Anyway, if you don’t pay, you’re not allowed to go the right way.

10
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,380
Then you have to give something

11
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:31,260
You didn't like it

12
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:38,330
Mao Huiqi's wife

13
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,330
You can still earn

14
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,330
Give it to me and mom first

15
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:41,330
Didn't eat a bite today

16
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,330
Yes, good daughter-in-law

17
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:47,120
Grandma hasn’t eaten you for a day
